(7567313, 1214025, 67258, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous photography, a real shame that the branch is in front of the lamb on the left.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous photography, a real shame that the branch is in front of the lamb on the left.', '2018-04-30 03:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567314, 1214054, 67258, '<td valign="top">I do find myself conflicted by this photo.  The process of taking it has the potential to effectively kill your subject as the parents may abandon the nest, but what a cracking photo it makes.  There again, it may be a remote set up or nest cam.  6 for now, but may adjust up or down as I dwell on it for the rest of the week.</td>', 'I do find myself conflicted by this photo.  The process of taking it has the potential to effectively kill your subject as the parents may abandon the nest, but what a cracking photo it makes.  There again, it may be a remote set up or nest cam.  6 for now, but may adjust up or down as I dwell on it for the rest of the week.', '2018-04-30 03:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
