(7567879, 1214350, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>A lovely wildlife shot in very natural looking surroundings. I don''t know if this was a captive animal but I like its intense stare together with your composition that rightly has the fox looking into the empty frame. Very good use of DOF and good sharp focus on the eyes, it all works really well together, nice one...</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well A lovely wildlife shot in very natural looking surroundings. I don''t know if this was a captive animal but I like its intense stare together with your composition that rightly has the fox looking into the empty frame. Very good use of DOF and good sharp focus on the eyes, it all works really well together, nice one...', '2018-05-07 06:34:38.000000', NULL, 0),
